{:strongs 7307, :hebrew "רוח", :lang :zh-Hans, :gloss "wind; by resemblance breath, i.e. a sensible (or even violent) exhalation; figuratively, life, anger, unsubstantiality; by extension, a region of the sky; by resemblance spirit, but only of a rational being (including its expression and functions)", :text "风；引申为气息，即可感知的（甚至猛烈的）呼出；比喻义为生命、愤怒、虚空；扩展义为天空的区域；引申为鲁阿（灵），但仅用于理性存在（包括其表达与功能）。", :model "glm-5.2", :timestamp "2026-07-27T01:59:01.906026633Z"}